## 3. Causality Assessment

### WHO-UMC Causality Scale
* Classification: Probable / Likely
* Rationale:
  1. Clear temporal relationship (onset 5 days after adding Fluconazole to Rosuvastatin).
  2. Positive de-challenge with complete biochemical recovery upon drug withdrawal.
  3. Alternative etiologies (trauma, viral infection, exercise) were ruled out.

